    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Honestly, there is a real risk—the new engine is optimized for speed, not for the subtle, multi-layered judgment calls your VIPs expect. It can process data faster, but it won't catch the unspoken cues or the emotional context that make your service feel bespoke. If you roll this out without a human oversight layer, you're not just risking complaints—you're risking a mass exodus to a competitor who still offers that nuance. I'd recommend a phased rollout with a dedicated concierge team double-checking every output, and a clear escalation path for any client who feels the shift. That's the only way to protect your reputation.",
